urt to hold an evidentiary hearing pursuant to Franks v. Delaware, 438 U.S. 154 (1978).\n\n(JUDGE J. MICHAEL SEABRIGHT)(rlfh) (Entered: 01/19/2026)\n01/19/2026 147 EXHIBIT LIST RE: DEFENDANT'S PRETRIAL MOTION NO. 3, MOTION TO SUPPRESS 1B10, ECF NO. 136 by USA as toDarren Patrick Riley. (Perlmutter, Rebecca) Modified on 1/21/2026 (jni) (Entered: 01/19/2026)\n01/19/2026 148 WITNESS LIST GOVERNMENT'S WITNESS LIST RE: DEFENDANT'S PRETRIAL MOTION NO. 3, MOTION TO SUPPRESS 1B10, ECF NO. 136 by USA as to Darren Patrick Riley. (Perlmutter, Rebecca) Modified on\n1/21/2026 (jni) (Entered: 01/19/2026)\n\n01/19/2026 149 EXHIBIT LIST GOVERNMENT'S EXHIBIT LIST RE: DEFENDANT'S PRETRIAL MOTION NO. 2, MOTION TO SUPPRESS 1B15, ECF NO. 135 by USA as to Darren Patrick Riley. (Perlmutter, Rebecca) Modified on 1/21/2026\n(jni) (Entered: 01/19/2026)\n\n01/19/2026 150 WITNESS LIST GOVERNMENT'S WITNESS LIST RE: DEFENDANT'S PRETRIAL MOTION NO. 2, MOTION TO SUPPRESS 1B15, ECF NO. 135 by USA as to Darren Patrick Riley. (Perlmutter, Rebecca) Modified on\n1/21/2026 (jni) (Entered: 01/19/2026)\n\n01/19/2026 151 EXHIBIT LIST Defendant's Exhibit List ECF 135, Defendant's Pretrial Motion No. 2 Re: Motion to Suppress Seizure of Red iPhone (1B15) by Darren Patrick Riley. (Kennedy, Andrew) Modified on 1/21/2026 (jni) (Entered:\n01/19/2026)\n01/19/2026 152 WITNESS LIST Defendant's Witness List ECF 135, Defendant's Pretrial Motion No. 2 Re: Motion to Suppress Seizure of Red iPhone (1B15) by Darren Patrick Riley. (Kennedy, Andrew) Modified on 1/21/2026 (jni) (Entered:\n01/19/2026)\n01/19/2026 153 EXHIBIT LIST Defendant's Exhibit List ECF 136, Defendant's Pretrial Motion No. 3 Re: Request for Franks Hearing Re: Motion to Suppress iPhone 13 Pro Max (1B10) by Darren Patrick Riley. (Kennedy, Andrew)\nModified on 1/21/2026 (jni) (Entered: 01/19/2026)\n\n01/19/2026 154 WITNESS LIST Defendant's Witness List ECF 136, Defendant's Pretrial Motion No. 3 Re: Request for Franks Hearing Re: Motion to Suppress iPhone 13